      "content": "That's a good start on the tone. To make it even more effective for the students to see the \"logic\" used back then, could you expand on that? Specifically, can you elaborate on the distinctions the administrator would make between \"civilized\" European societies and the indigenous populations? I want the students to see how the administrator would justify the actual hierarchy of cultures and the idea that certain groups are inherently less capable of self-governance.",
